t 9362cc8c succeeded and produced sdist plus wheel version 0.12.6.dev38+g9362cc8c0. Twine check passed for both artifacts. The initial no-isolation attempt failed only because the reviewer venv had an older Setuptools than pyproject requires; rerun with declared build isolation installed setuptools\u003e=80 and passed. Signed source worktree remained clean. Verdict remains changes requested for lifecycle seam false negatives."}}
